   "originalText": "restricted-v2 (8 app Deployments, no runAsUser) / nonroot-v2 (postgres, kafka via SA mea-infra) / anyuid+runAsUser:0 (otel-lgtm only).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
